ikes? Wall jump first for a good angle to chain together dashes? Reposition an enemy for an ideal route?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/0efb09af9a70334eae5efb33bf3ffc7e.poster.avif?t=1774198013\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/0efb09af9a70334eae5efb33bf3ffc7e.webm?t=1774198013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/0efb09af9a70334eae5efb33bf3ffc7e.mp4?t=1774198013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hints. Just your brain, your controller, and the ability to phase dash. Will you rise to the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/6a7e9f0974236104b6668d64228bb8a0.avif?t=1774198013\" width=600 height=180 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phase dash</strong> - Walls and platforms can no longer stop you. Choose how to utilize your dash to make it to the end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dangerous speed</strong> - Phasing through an enemy or dangerous object grants you an extra mid-air dash. Chain together dashes to avoid death and blaze past barriers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tricky navigation</strong> - Disappearing dash platforms, hovering ghosts, directional push arrows, and more will lay between you and the exit. Observe, learn, and experiment. Think carefully how to maneuver through the levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level timer</strong> - The timer saves the fastest time you've achieved on each level. There is no online leaderboard. The focus is on you to figure out the fastest route and improve on your best time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level ranks</strong> - Aim for the S, A, B, or C rank on a level based on completion time! Speedrunners can hunt for the S rank times or even the secret Z rank times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong> - Remappable controls (for controller and keyboard), screenshake disable, and shadow removal allow you to enjoy the experience your way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/a4ab53dc95a496ef0a847415ee8b22db.avif?t=1774198013\" width=600 height=180 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Invent your own path! Phase through walls with your dash and blaze towards the exit. Death Unphased is a short experience fusing precision and puzzle platforming. Speedrun the smartest routes and aim to beat your fastest time in each level.", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“If you're a fan of the precision platformer genre or are looking for a game to spend hours grinding for the best time possible, Death Unphased is going to be a great title for you to pick up.”<br>GameGrin<br><br>“...Death Unphased is exactly what you think it is, and it is a brilliant example of the genre.”<br>Gert Lush Gaming<br><br>“Death Unphased has mad flow.”<br>LumosJared<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/header.jpg?t=1774198013", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774198013", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774198013", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul